                        ],
                        "form": "notoriétés"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f553869d-689a-3835-93fa-e1cdf346371a",
                        "entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Connaissance générale, publique, d’un fait."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e411087-0a07-4a5c-a383-344a951805a4",
                                "sense_id": "f553869d-689a-3835-93fa-e1cdf346371a",
                                "text": "Le clergé réuni reconnut la force du plaidoyer, ainsi que la notoriété des circonstances sur lesquelles il se fondait […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e44eb56-c50b-3d07-82b4-bc43e0e017e2",
                        "entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État d’une personne fort connue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7206449e-afd3-49f5-9429-33baef33a5ec",
                                "sense_id": "6e44eb56-c50b-3d07-82b4-bc43e0e017e2",
                                "text": "Ah ! le temps joyeux de la stupidité, de pharisaïsme à rebours où les petits messieurs pressés se hissaient paisiblement sur la crête de la notoriété. Tous des faiseurs, tous des faisans."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9336ca83-2bb9-489f-b0cf-e8e9aa10d058",
                                "sense_id": "6e44eb56-c50b-3d07-82b4-bc43e0e017e2",
                                "text": "La notoriété médiatique de la photo y repose sur ses qualités de documentarité (elle fait document) et de testimonialité (elle atteste)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9dbb9624-5ce9-441c-ab80-d9555aa00671",
                                "sense_id": "6e44eb56-c50b-3d07-82b4-bc43e0e017e2",
                                "text": "Cet événement, qui jouit d'une réputation internationale, présente des oeuvres issues des nouveaux courants artistiques ; l'occasion est donc belle de faire valoir la complexité de mon travail et d'accroître ma notoriété."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "43c619c8-a5d1-3da7-a047-1d3c1e790c52",
                        "entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne connue, célébrité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21269bb9-f9d2-4b8a-95f4-067cefed500e",
                                "sense_id": "43c619c8-a5d1-3da7-a047-1d3c1e790c52",
                                "text": "Tu voulais voir ton nom cité parmi les notoriétés, le soir de la « générale » au Châtelet…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ff09e5f-16f0-492e-b272-4d77a3fabf69",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "target_lang_word": "Offenkundigkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2691b1f4-2dfa-42ab-b3bd-4d5fa23adcff",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bekanntheit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bekanntheit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb8fdc61-1d05-3b56-8b55-cc0c9e39c864",
                                        "entry_id": "7c03cc56-d6ff-3591-8306-0c78f7cf42ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Umstand, von vielen gekannt zu werden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50c59bc7-2b82-42aa-8a2f-d4a3f173c370",
                                                "sense_id": "bb8fdc61-1d05-3b56-8b55-cc0c9e39c864",
                                                "text": "„Aber er kann helfen, die Bekanntheit eines Projekts zu steigern und einen Künstler bekannter zu machen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f199dd71-cb33-4ec2-9bcc-e41b3d0bedb6",
                                                "sense_id": "bb8fdc61-1d05-3b56-8b55-cc0c9e39c864",
                                                "text": "„Mit der wachsenden Bekanntheit des Brunello hat auch der lokale Tourismus Auftrieb erhalten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edc1974e-32bd-456e-b6df-04c947e91f5b",
                                                "sense_id": "bb8fdc61-1d05-3b56-8b55-cc0c9e39c864",
                                                "text": "„Die Bekanntheit und die, nach Wielands Urteil, verfehlten bisherigen Bearbeitungen sind ein Grund für seine Stoffwahl.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e44a162-66d4-3544-8c56-d0051d9f2ed1",
                                        "entry_id": "7c03cc56-d6ff-3591-8306-0c78f7cf42ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "prominente Person"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea8e0563-24b5-4d13-bb4e-d76501264c8a",
                                                "sense_id": "0e44a162-66d4-3544-8c56-d0051d9f2ed1",
                                                "text": "„Auch die Unerreichbarkeit, das Funkeln und die Distanz, die der Begriff Star beinhaltet, sind bei diesen Bekanntheiten nicht mehr vorhanden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b69a935-c35e-42a1-a333-facca3892fa6",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "target_lang_word": "reputation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "reputation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                        "entry_id": "677ba6cc-1d8a-37e7-87dd-a6752e847ae7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "What somebody or something is known for."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d30c9bc7-e4b7-4d66-bcdb-f4b79d6e9f40",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                                "text": "And Balaam (or as the trueth of the hebrewe hath Bileam) doth signifie the people of no reputation\n or the vayne people or they that are not counted for people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37799a24-5d7b-408f-8f43-6da3c8600868",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                                "text": "Sometimes a man makes a reputation, deserved or otherwise, by a single action."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7e4e278-c361-4fc8-870b-7a14d2fc5bb0",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                                "text": "The reputations of our universities and our research base are already under threat because of the fallout from the EU referendum result, which is making the UK an unfriendlier place for overseas scholars and students, as well as cutting off access to an important stream of research funding and to a vibrant and well-developed ecosystem for collaborative work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "50610c4d-4798-4f2f-869b-23e397d58987",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "target_lang_word": "notability",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "notability",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d084fc21-fcb1-3ad0-bf94-fa30975a3b99",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being notable or eminent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d32cfa9b-b5fb-3ded-92b3-9a1f4f8c674c",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A notable or eminent person or thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a3f4e88-8630-4dd1-bddb-ff09de457be0",
                                                "sense_id": "d32cfa9b-b5fb-3ded-92b3-9a1f4f8c674c",
                                                "text": "Lesser notabilities have indeed utilized and built upon the opportunities created for filling in the gaps within the socioeconomic and political maps of the popular community."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c4022f9-2214-30cb-acac-ec7b6746c6f5",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Locally eminent people; the bourgeoisie or upper middle class"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "912e7c57-02c2-4e6e-8f8e-864b59a3fb22",
                                                "sense_id": "3c4022f9-2214-30cb-acac-ec7b6746c6f5",
                                                "text": "Just as the notability lived in its own social universe between the common citizenry and the aristocracy, so too did its intellectual universe express this complex mediation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca515fb7-f67f-4140-aa2f-f8f5557b4c19",
                                                "sense_id": "3c4022f9-2214-30cb-acac-ec7b6746c6f5",
                                                "text": "Such petitions were part of the role of the notability as understood at the time; a manifestation of their social hegemony was the obligation to speak for or represent the local community to the imperial center."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34a25663-8993-3ce9-bc4d-2b82a1266839",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A standard used to determine whether a subject merits its own article."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4712c8ec-db26-495c-9311-62cf30690b65",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb2283fe-f809-33c3-bb1c-91e23dc8b32d",
                        "target_lang_word": "notoriety",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "notoriety",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17f05999-acf4-3950-894e-821d8a550718",
                                        "entry_id": "0cd5e1f2-ea2b-3570-ac38-904dd9a53e17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An infamous or notorious condition or reputation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e6b2cd4-c35c-4c18-b4ca-fd2fe407e24e",
                                                "sense_id": "17f05999-acf4-3950-894e-821d8a550718",
                                                "text": "[H]e who portrays examples of disinterestedness and intrepidity, confers on virtue the notoriety and homage that are due to it, and rouses in the spectators, the spirit of salutary emulation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a9999e5-b3ee-4140-919e-c89daf861383",
                                                "sense_id": "17f05999-acf4-3950-894e-821d8a550718",
                                                "text": "I liked the man for his own sake, and even had he promised to turn out a celebrity it would have had no weight with me. I look upon notoriety with the same indifference as on the buttons on a man's shirt-front, or the crest on his note-paper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b00c1451-6f11-4549-bda4-e231c7004a86",
                                                "sense_id": "17f05999-acf4-3950-894e-821d8a550718",
                                                "text": "This seems to me to be a reasonable request, and I will try to explain to you what it is that has given me this false notoriety; so please give me your attention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
